  "details": "I logged in to test out one of my models to work, only to find that the new Avatar update has gone live. I personally do not like the avatar tab changes that have been done.\n\nTo me as a creator and as someone who does work in the UX field, it seems like you are trying to push the work we do personally on our models aside for the marketplace.\n\nIt shows me that VRChat wants to eventually stop individuals from uploading their own work and solely rely on the marketplace, taking away our individuality and our own creativity.\n\nThis is an easy fix. Can I please have it to my avatar list? I won't be using your marketplace, as I would prefer to support other creators by buying a model I can change and edit. The other option is just having an option to turn off the marketplace.",
